                        4444 --1768: **  - Outline
                        4445 --1769: **      Writes the data to the Switch Area on the back side (invalid side)
                        4446 --1770: **  - Format
                        4447 --1771: **      void
                        4448 --1772: **          R_RFD_WriteSwitchRequest(
                        4449 --1773: **              T_u4_RfdBuffer   i_pu4_Data
                        4450 --1774: **          );
                        4451 --1775: **  - Input parameter
                        4452 --1776: **      i_pu4_Data : Address of the buffer storing the write data
                        4453 --1777: **  - Return
                        4454 --1778: **      non return value
                        4455 --1779: **  - Preconditions
                        4456 --1780: **      The state of the flash memory must be the READY state
                        4457 --1781: **      The flash access status must not be the command-locked state
                        4458 --1782: **      The FACI mode must be the data flash P/E mode
                        4459 --1783: **  
