                        7596 --2663: /**********************************************************************************************************************
                        7597 --2664: **  Function Name   : rfd_fu4_CheckSecuritySettingArea
                        7598 --2665: **  
                        7599 --2666: **  - Outline
                        7600 --2667: **      Checks whether data is stored correctly in the Security Setting Area in the Hardware Property Area
                        7601 --2668: **  - Format
                        7602 --2669: **      T_u4_RFDReturn
                        7603 --2670: **          rfd_fu4_CheckSecuritySettingArea(void);
                        7604 --2671: **  - Input parameter
                        7605 --2672: **      non input parameter
                        7606 --2673: **  - Return
                        7607 --2674: **      R_RFD_OK                        : Normal End
                        7608 --2675: **      R_RFD_ERR_SWITCH_DATA           : Some data in Switch Area are not correct
                        7609 --2676: **      R_RFD_ERR_SECURITY_DATA         : Some data in Security Setting Area are not correct
                        7610 --2677: **  - Preconditions
                        7611 --2678: **      The state of the flash memory must be the READY state
                        7612 --2679: **      The flash access status must not be the command-locked state
                        7613 --2680: **      The value of AnPC (n = 0 or 1) in the Switch Area must indicate that the area is programmed
                        7614 --2681: **  
