                        8579 --3156: **  - Return
                        8580 --3157: **      R_RFD_OK                        : Normal End
                        8581 --3158: **      R_RFD_ERR_SWITCH_DATA           : Some data in Switch Area are not correct
                        8582 --3159: **      R_RFD_ERR_BLOCKPROTECTION1_DATA : Some data in Block Protection Area for FACI1 are not correct
                        8583 --3160: **  - Preconditions
                        8584 --3161: **      The state of the flash memory must be the READY state
                        8585 --3162: **      The flash access status must not be the command-locked state
                        8586 --3163: **      The value of AnPC (n = 0 or 1) in the Switch Area must indicate that the area is programmed
